# Labelled evaluation set for the confidence threshold.
#
# Each line is one discovery case with the evidence facts the verifier would have
# produced, plus a human label:
#
#     label 1 = worth storing and (if confirmed) worth alerting
#     label 0 = should be discarded as not evidence-qualified
#
# This is a **seed set assembled by hand from realistic announcement shapes**, not
# a statistically valid study. It exists so the operating threshold is derived
# from measured precision/recall instead of being invented. Expand it before
# trusting the number; the report records the current size and its limitation.

